                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"0b5fae13-db30-4836-b432-228dddd1eb62\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/>От­рез­ки <var data-math-identifier=\"D\">D</var><var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var>  и <var data-math-identifier=\"D\">D</var><sub>1</sub><var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var><sub>1</sub> лежат на па­рал­лель­ных пря­мых, по­это­му ис­ко­мый угол между пря­мы­ми <var data-math-identifier=\"A\">A</var><sub>1</sub><var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var><sub>1</sub> и  <var data-math-identifier=\"D\">D</var><var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var> равен углу между пря­мы­ми <var data-math-identifier=\"A\">A</var><sub>1</sub><var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var><sub>1</sub> и  <var data-math-identifier=\"D\">D</var><sub>1</sub><var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var><sub>1</sub>.</p><p>Из пря­мо­уголь­но­го тре­уголь­ни­ка <var data-math-identifier=\"A\">A</var><sub>1</sub><var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var><sub>1</sub><var data-math-identifier=\"D\">D</var><sub>1</sub> по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"A_1C_1=\\sqrt{(D_1C_1)^{2}+(A_1D_1)^{2}}=\\sqrt{64+36}=10\"></span>.</p></center><p>Тогда для угла <var data-math-identifier=\"A\">A</var><sub>1</sub><var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var><sub>1</sub><var data-math-identifier=\"D\">D</var><sub>1</sub> имеем:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin A_1C_1D_1=\\frac{A_1D_1}{A_1C_1}=\\frac{6}{10}=0{,}6\"></span>. </p></center>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
